    "failure_scenario": "Curated mode, `interface P extends HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>, BigBox {}`. The HTML layer fills `notableInherited.className` first (the resolver skips BigBox's copy because the name is taken). BigBox's collapsed layer also has `className` in `members`, and the checker answers `className` with parent BigBox. The loop removes the HTML `className`, merges BigBox's checker prop over it (keeping HTML's description and tags, because the checker answers \"\" for .ts files), and `move_notable` puts it back with parent BigBox. The checker lane now shows a mixed BigBox/HTML `className`, while the structural lane shows the HTMLAttributes one."
  },
