    "failure_scenario": "`Omit<Pick<Huge, 'h0'|...|'h299'>, 'h0'>`: 'h0' goes into `picked` although it is omitted. A dependency interface `extends Pick<SystemProps, ...300 keys>` (a style-props source) puts all 300 names into `picked`, so the checker lane never collapses that source. Any other source sharing those names (`picked` holds names, not sources) is under-counted and may be listed instead of collapsed at the threshold."
